{"4559190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Fugue", "steam_appid": 4559190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Fugue</strong> is a retro-inspired space exploration and crafting game where every planet is a self-contained mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between handcrafted worlds, land anywhere, and uncover strange environments filled with puzzles and forgotten technology. To go further, you’ll design and build your own space infrastructure—launch platforms, orbital systems, and interplanetary networks that expand your reach across the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Just you, your ship, and a solar system that’s slowly coming apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you piece together fragments of a lost civilization, a deeper truth emerges—one that ties every planet, every structure, and every anomaly into something far more deliberate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully simulated N-body mini solar system</strong>, where gravity dynamically influences every celestial body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine resources, craft tools, and build outposts</strong> across multiple unique planets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Program your own solutions with “Orbit,” an in-game scripting language</strong>—automate systems, launch rockets, deploy satellites, or even create your own text-based adventure games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamlessly explore planets on foot or pilot your spaceship between worlds</strong>, uncovering the mysteries of a living solar system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic planetary transformations</strong>—worlds evolve as they orbit. Ice giants melt into oceans and refreeze depending on their distance from the sun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune into in-game radio stations—or import your own music</strong> to create a fully personalized soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Fugue</strong> is a retro-inspired space exploration and crafting game where every planet is a self-contained mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between handcrafted worlds, land anywhere, and uncover strange environments filled with puzzles and forgotten technology. To go further, you’ll design and build your own space infrastructure—launch platforms, orbital systems, and interplanetary networks that expand your reach across the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Just you, your ship, and a solar system that’s slowly coming apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you piece together fragments of a lost civilization, a deeper truth emerges—one that ties every planet, every structure, and every anomaly into something far more deliberate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully simulated N-body mini solar system</strong>, where gravity dynamically influences every celestial body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine resources, craft tools, and build outposts</strong> across multiple unique planets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Program your own solutions with “Orbit,” an in-game scripting language</strong>—automate systems, launch rockets, deploy satellites, or even create your own text-based adventure games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamlessly explore planets on foot or pilot your spaceship between worlds</strong>, uncovering the mysteries of a living solar system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic planetary transformations</strong>—worlds evolve as they orbit. Ice giants melt into oceans and refreeze depending on their distance from the sun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune into in-game radio stations—or import your own music</strong> to create a fully personalized soundtrack.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A space exploration and crafting game set in a fully simulated N-body small scale solar system, where you build space infrastructure to progress and figure out the misteries of the cosmos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559190/0287ba59b57767d57d07f5ec9e3c0e37b7a44800/header.jpg?t=1779712508", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559190/86d782e42873e0dd989a97aad884cb049793d288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779712508", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559190/86d782e42873e0dd989a97aad884cb049793d288/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779712508", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> IntelCore I3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> IntelCore I5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> steamos3.7</li></ul>", "recommen